#[ Writ: pure-build-rs fixture ]

##[ parser-purity ]

@pure{
  crates: [ "core" ]
  forbid: [ "std::fs" ]
  allow-external: [ ]
}

The forbidden path is in `core/build.rs`, not under `core/src/`. A build
script runs at compile time and is exactly how a crate that may not touch
the filesystem acquires the ability anyway.
